  "goodToKnow": "Der Pionier (die Pionierin) is a pioneer: ein Pionier der Luftfahrt, Pionierarbeit leisten. In the GDR, children aged 6 to 14 joined the Junge Pioniere and Thälmann-Pioniere, wearing blue and red neckerchiefs, before moving to the FDJ youth organisation. In the army, Pioniere are combat engineers who build bridges and clear mines. Plural: die Pioniere."
